<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39718" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικίνδῡν-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in danger, insecure</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.86
			</span></i>.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά; ἐ. ἦν μὴ λαμφθείη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.239
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσοδοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					36.11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἐπικινδύνῳ</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ ἀσφαλεῖ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.137
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
				<i>dangerous</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διδάσκαλοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gorg.
					<u>Pal.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατεῖαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					467d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρρωστίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Ir.</u>
					p.29
				</span></i>
			 W.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεινὴ καὶ ἐ. ἔρις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					736c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				4.6.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οτέρα πρᾶξις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>An.</u>
					1.3.19
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span> to one, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				4.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.54
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικίνδυνόν [ἐστι</span>]
				<i>there is danger</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				588a10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νως</span>
			<i>with danger</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίκτειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					5.55
				</span></i>
			; <i>at one's</i>
			<i>risk</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.37
			</span></i>; <i>in a precarious</i> or <i>critical state</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					502
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					682
				</span></i>
			.</div>
